      "rationale": "Both current mandatory cases extract a finite-window frequency rate, vary that window/noise and infer a mass through positive quantities with rational and reciprocal exponents. Wholeae201 requires the same interval-consistent difference quotient, its sign, units and finite-interval limitation in tabular and functional representations. Whole88abc requires roots and reciprocal powers, with no independent negative-base scaling. A provided-rate-only route would omit current signal extraction; a full exact derivative algorithm is not required. The degeneracy of component masses, uncertainty, redshift/model regime remain Physics and are retained. Current-Main informed successor: same whole mandatory P, all cases/axes and whole Math alternatives independently reconsidered by this author in worked-cases-and-necessity.author.json. Original rationale/solutions are preserved with original identity; this native rebinding creates no independent approval. The complete BYPh13GA-ASTRO.4 passage supports optical/GW mass inference and bounded models, not the exact leading-order formula in every one of16 jurisdictions. SourcePlacement remains separate.",
